<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-wangminzhi" book-id="b-epitaph-wangminzhi-full" chapter-id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full" source-id="s-epitaph-wangminzhi-ntu2009-cc75be5">
  <p id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed">晉故<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBCA">男子</persName>琅耶臨沂都鄉南仁里<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBCA">王閩之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBCA">冶民</persName>故尚書左僕射特進衛將軍<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0030" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">彬</persName>之<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0032" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBCA">孫</persName>贛令<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0035" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBC">興之</persName>之<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0038" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBCA">元子</persName>年廿八升平二年三月九日卒葬于舊墓在<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0057" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBC">贛令</persName>墓之後故刻塼於墓為識<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0069" ref="lhb_bow_dtk">妻</persName>吳興<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0072" ref="lhb_bow_dtk">施氏</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0075" ref="lhb_bow_dtk">女式</persName><rs id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0077" type="unresolved">弟</rs><persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0078" ref="7a1_osp_b1n">嗣之</persName><persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0080" ref="8pa_jhb_7q0">咸之</persName><persName id="c-epitaph-wangminzhi-full:p001:m0082" ref="chc_358_0lv">預之</persName></p>
</text>
